  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Hei Cheng uses an investigative killer move to locate Fairy Li Shan’s figure inside pear orchard, then fires dark arrow Immortal Gu at the found target.",
      "chapters": [
        689
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_cheng",
        "char_fairy_li_shan",
        "gu_dark_arrow"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Cang Yu’s investigative killer move micro sense is praised as something that can sell for five immortal essence stones in treasure yellow heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        698
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_cang_yu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Without investigative killer moves, Gu Immortals can still prepare large numbers of investigative Gu worms of all paths to enhance vision and hearing, sense tremors, smell odd odors, and spread divine sense. That stacked scouting is treated as a substitute when the killer move itself is missing. Fang Yuan and Hei Lou Lan both note the lack of investigative killer moves when fog and illusion obstruct true senses.",
      "chapters": [
        714
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "versus-investigative-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_investigative_gu",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_hei_lou_lan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hundred li eye is an investigative killer move traded on treasure yellow heaven. As a mortal killer move valued at six immortal essence stones, it lets a Gu Immortal observe scenery within one hundred li as clearly as the lines on one’s palm.",
      "chapters": [
        732
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hundred-li-eye",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tai Bai Yun Sheng fails to sense a captured soul because he does not have an immortal level investigative killer move.",
      "chapters": [
        870
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-grade-gap",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Killer moves in general are covered on killer moves. Battlefield domains that remake the fight space are covered on Battlefield Killer Move.",
